---@field consecutive_fails? number The number of consecutive fails required from a health check before changing the health to unhealthy.
---@field consecutive_successes? number The number of consecutive successes required from a health check before changing the health to healthy.
---@field created_on? string
---@field description? string A human-readable description of the health check.
